[["heading","R E F E R E N C E  /  C O N T I N U E  L E A R N I N G\nSources and further practice"],["text","Course sources: Full_Stack_SE_Internship_Checklist.pdf, section 32 (page 11);\nSections_04-34_Full_Stack_Interview_Study_Guide.pdf, section 32 (pages 91–94). Original order and\nfive previous additions retained. Twelve new exercises are selected for internship interview practice."],["heading","Language references"],["text","Java language and collections: docs.oracle.com/en/java/"],["text","JavaScript reference: developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript"],["text","React reference: react.dev/learn"],["text","Express guide: expressjs.com"],["text","MySQL manual: dev.mysql.com/doc/"],["text","Git reference: git-scm.com/docs"],["heading","How to discuss your solution"],["text","Requirements → Example → Brute force → Optimized solution → Dry run → Edge cases →\nComplexity."],["sinhala","","Interview එJකේ final answer එකට කලින් ඔයාJගේ thinking process එක පැහැදිලි කරන්න. Jනාදන්නා Jදයකේ තිබුJ)ාත් assumption එකකේ Jලස කියන්න.",441]]